// scene_init used to be defined and never called, so wall_verts/wall_colors/
// target_verts/target_colors were NULL at every `(import ...)` site and
// gl_draw_tris rejected them: the maze rendered with no walls and no targets,
// silently. An export does not exist until its declaring function runs, and
// each link of an init chain is capped at 3 actions, so dropping one is easy
// and nothing complains -- which is why this chain has one root and every
// exporting function is reachable from it.
create_world() {
  create_actors();
  create_scene_meshes();
} return void;
